  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The Institut Français de l’Hôtellerie (IFH) is a leading hospitality business school in Paris, established to train students in luxury hospitality. You’ll find a wide range of programmes from Bachelor's degrees through to Master’s in Business and Hospitality, Gastronomy, and Luxury Management.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>Life at IFH is multicultural, as you’ll find students from all over the world. IFH supports you by offering integration services, helping with day-to-day life and getting you in touch with mentors.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>IFH works with two student residence partners to support you in securing student accommodation, whether in residences near campus or in shared apartments.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>As a hospitality business school, IFH has training spaces and special facilities, such as an application restaurant, fully equipped kitchens and hotel management areas, so that you can gain hands-on experience from close supervision by industry experts.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
